    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "These battle thought Gu are meant for the black banner elite troop. In battle the Gu enter their brains, surge their battle intent, and make them fearless. Few battle thoughts appear, but with them guarding beside the elite troop, that troop forcibly resists the star thought cloud’s impact for the first time in the clash. The troop’s own firm willpower already helps against thought impact; battle thoughts add further protection.",
